ind":"mint","templateId":456298}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":641,"col":"funmanbobyjo","cat":"","name":"Thunder Crash Bomb (Void Crash Bomb)","desc":"The Thunder Crash Bombs is a loud, gunpowder filled bamboo shoot that is detrimental to those who are in its explosive range. These versatile explosives can be quickly crafted by filling the hollow void of a bamboo shoot with whatever shrapnel and gunpowder you have on hand from the wastelands and sealing the ends with dung to hold it in place. The Thunder Crash Bomb is a Poojutsu snare used by the Dung Ninjas for eons. Enclosed in a tender bamboo shoot, which can be formed into any shape for any situation, the Thunder Crash Bomb is used as both a loud distraction as well as an effective form of assassination. Legend has it, that the bamboo shoot is best used after it has been digested and expelled by a panda, but this theory is likely just a myth... The name \"Thunder Crash Bomb\" comes from the extremely loud and thunderous crash that echoes out from the location of this bomb's detonation. Even when the explosion is not close enough to kill someone, the noise of the impact is so loud it could scare a whole goblin army back to their goblin mommies.\n\n(The Void Crash Bombs is an extremely loud and awesomely magical, gunpowder filled bamboo shoot that is detrimental to those who are near its explosive range. These enchanted explosives can be carefully crafted by filling the hollow void of a bamboo shoot with gunpowder under the light of the full moon, and sealing the ends in place with dung. The Void Crash Bomb is an advanced Poojutsu snare used by the Mystic Dung Ninjas for eons. Enclosed in a magic bamboo shoot, which can be formed into any shape for any situation, the Void Crash Bomb is used as both a loud distraction as well as an effective form of assassination. Legend has it, that the bamboo shoot is best used after it has been digested and expelled by a panda, but this theory is likely just a myth... The name \"Void Crash Bomb\" comes from the extremely loud void rift that echoes out from the location of this bomb's detonation as the fabric of space time is temporarily ripped. Even when the explosion is not close enough to kill someone, the noise and sight of the impact is so loud it could scare a whole goblin army back to their goblin mommies. This explosion is over twice as strong as a normal Thunder Crash Bomb.)\n\n\n**Outcomes:**\n\nThunder Crash Bomb - 20/21 (95.2381%)\nVoid Crash Bomb (Shiny) - 1/21 (4.7619%)\n\n\nJoin [here](https://t.me/funmanbobyjo) to learn more about to world of funmanbobyjo and how to obtain crafting ingedients from weekly air drops, events and quests!\n\nhttps://t.me/funmanbobyjo","img":"Qme3tikcTf7euPqSMMdzLkMriVsLgo4UT6Zj5zorW6PnzH","start":1630177500000,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":261407},{"index":1,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":261379},{"index":2,"count":2,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":197776},{"index":3,"count":1,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":210537}],"rolls":[{"total":21,"outcomes":[{"odds":20,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":263375}]},{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":263379}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":640,"col":"funmanbobyjo","cat":"","name":"Seed Bomb (Magic Seed Bomb)","desc":"This Seed Bomb is an explosion of beauty if you have a little patience. It is made with a Block of Clay and Viable Seeds. If thrown at a tree, it will explode, releasing seeds to the surrounding land. This will help bring pollinators to an area of wilderness as well as making the landscape breathtaking with a field of new flowers. \n\n (This Magic Seed Bomb is an explosion of mystical beauty that grows twice the speed of a normal Seed Bomb! It is made with a Block of Clay and Viable Seeds, but only if the stars are aligned just so... If thrown at a tree, it will explode, releasing magic seeds to the surrounding land. This will help bring pollinators to an area of wilderness as well as making the landscape breathtaking with a field of new flowers almost overnight.)\n\n\n**Outcomes:**\n\nSeed Bomb - 20/21 (95.2381%)\nMagic Seed Bomb (Shiny) - 1/21 (4.7619%)\n\n\nJoin [here](https://t.me/funmanbobyjo) to learn more about to world of funmanbobyjo and how to obtain crafting ingedients from weekly air drops, events and quests!\n\nhttps://t.me/funmanbobyjo","img":"QmVjeWPZeMR472Qx3LmJDvzgoijTYcVpTt3xpzzFcPW3iM","start":1630177565000,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":2,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":211141},{"index":1,"count":2,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":217614}],"rolls":[{"total":21,"outcomes":[{"odds":20,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":263364}]},{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":263370}]}]}],"unsupported":false},{"id":638,"col":"funmanbobyjo","cat":"","name":"Dung Dagger (Frosted Dung Dagger) Super Blend","desc":"The Dung Dagger is a basic beginner's weapon. Any novice fighter knows that a Dung Dagger is a cheap and easy way to enhance your fighting capabilities with very little to no experience. The hardening of dung is a ancient method of producing lethal materials from basic ingredients in order to mass produce cheap weaponry. Using this method, one is able to produce a low level army with dangerous, bacteria infected weaponry that is sharper than one would like to think... (This Frosted Dung Dagger is a rare, frost-treated dung dagger that has increased sharpness and a chillingly cold stab. This effect not only increases the grip of the dagger as it is frozen to the wielder's hand, but also penetrates the enemy with a stinging frost bite that can slow their very heart beat to a faint murmur.)\n\n\n**Outcomes:**\n\nDung Dagger - 99.5% \nFrosted Dung Dagger - 0.5% \n\n\nJoin [here](https://t.me/funmanbobyjo) to learn more about to world of funmanbobyjo and how to obtain crafting ingedients from weekly air drops, events and quests!\n\nhttps://t.me/funmanbobyjo","img":"QmbrtmT6ZU9xDzmhYB7rhJGsH4iao6ZdYyDpeXSmozZ4eP","start":1630173300000,"end":0,"max":0,"security":null,"ing":[{"index":0,"count":5,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":249550},{"index":1,"count":6,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":210537},{"index":2,"count":3,"burn":true,"to":null,"kind":"template","collection":"funmanbobyjo","templateId":197776}],"rolls":[{"total":200,"outcomes":[{"odds":199,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":262076}]},{"odds":1,"results":[{"kind":"mint","templateId":263327}]}]}],"unsupported":false}]}